  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• AetherNomad-iX for Travel: We make the customer their own agent, and cut out the chaos of websites that crowed you with prices, and price gouge on revisits, we exclusively provide you the best offer available in each cabin class!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different: We use A.I. to make you your own travel agent, curating, the most affordable Travel, Lodging, and Dining, in whatever your preferred travel stile may be!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn: Affiliates earn as we earn, every flight booked through your link earns you a quarter of the profit for now, so we can keep reinvesting to grow, and hopefully allow the our top affiliates to offer discounts and coupons sooner, rather than later, which would of course come with a higher incentive!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us: We picture the promotability being fairly robust, as travel could literally take you anywhere</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information: There is an additional option before customers check out, which allows them to opt in for a dining option, and hotel option for their stay, we don't book the reservations for these, so we charge a much smaller fee and simply allow the customer to book these two them selves with us having tracked down the best price and will be emailed to them upon check out with the relevant contact info, we also believe this to the safer option, do to things like religious accommodations and food allergy/dietary restrictions that the customers may need to discuss personally with the hotel and restaurant.</p></div></div>",
